UID:ac-interclub-01-opening@athleticscanterbury.org.nz
DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Pacific/Auckland:20261017T133000
DTEND;TZID=Pacific/Auckland:20261017T163000
TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:AC Senior Interclub - OPENING DAY
LOCATION:Ngā Puna Wai Sports Hub\, Augustine Drive\, Christchurch
DESCRIPTION:OPENING DAY — odd race distances. 200m hurdles = 10 flights
 \, 762mm all grades.\nTRACK: 80m\, 135m\, 300m\, 600m\, 1000m\, 2000m\, 
 Track Walk\, 200m hurdles\nFIELD: Long Jump\, High Jump\, Pole Vault\, S
 hot Put\, Discus\, Javelin\nSprint format (trialled this half-season\, o
 ne of three options):\n  i.  60m followed by 100m (as in previous season
 s)\n  ii. 2 x 100m relay followed by 100m (teams of TWO\, enter on the d
 ay)\n  iii. 100m heats followed by 100m final (advise if opting out of t
 he final)\n\nNOTE: the AC website lists the start as "1:30 am" — read 
 as 1:30 pm (the Children's Interclub runs 9:00am-1:00pm beforehand).\n\n
 Entries via AthleticNET\; entries close Thursday 11:45pm. Seeded program
 me and live results on AthleticLIVE.\nFees: all grades $8.50 incl. first
  event\, $1.50 per additional event (plus AthleticNET fees).\nRelay even
 ts can be added to any interclub on request by club / school teams.\nPro
 gramme source: AC 2026-2027 Interclub Event Schedule (Draft September 20
 26).\nhttps://athleticscanterbury.org.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AC-2
 026-2027-Interclub-Event-Schedule-Pre-Christmas.pdf
CATEGORIES:Senior Track and Field
URL:https://athleticscanterbury.org.nz/events/ac-senior-interclub-opening
 -day-2/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
